    "TitleKey": "ORS_MedicalAid_HaulingLarge_title",
    "Description": "Hey, it\u2019s El.\n\nOff the bat \u2013 this particular job\u2019s a big deal, so if you\u2019re looking to take this one on for us, make sure you\u2019re confident in your ability to do a job well. \n\nWe\u2019ve been contracted by Crusader to deliver medical supplies to <EM4>~mission(Destination|Target|Address)</EM4>. Pick up\u2019s at <EM4>~mission(Location|Target|Address)</EM4>. Bear in mind, this is gonna be a big one, so make sure bring a <EM4>handheld tractor beam</EM4> and a ship that can hold <EM4>~mission(MissionMaxSCUSize) cargo containers</EM4> otherwise it might be a little rough.\n\nI can\u2019t stress the importance of this contract enough \u2013 lots of good people got hurt in those attacks, and it\u2019s our responsibility to do what we can to help them in the aftermath. We owe the victims that much, at the very least.\n\nLet\u2019s do right by them,\n\nElla Tieno \nJr. Logistics Coordinator \nCovalex Shipping   \n'Anything you need, anywhere you need it.'",
    "DescriptionKey": "ORS_MedicalAid_HaulingLarge_Desc",
    "DisplayDescription": "Hey, it\u2019s El.\n\nOff the bat \u2013 this particular job\u2019s a big deal, so if you\u2019re looking to take this one on for us, make sure you\u2019re confident in your ability to do a job well. \n\nWe\u2019ve been contracted by Crusader to deliver medical supplies to <EM4>Seraphim Station</EM4>. Pick up\u2019s at <EM4>[Location|Target|Address]</EM4>. Bear in mind, this is gonna be a big one, so make sure bring a <EM4>handheld tractor beam</EM4> and a ship that can hold <EM4>24 SCU cargo containers</EM4> otherwise it might be a little rough.\n\nI can\u2019t stress the importance of this contract enough \u2013 lots of good people got hurt in those attacks, and it\u2019s our responsibility to do what we can to help them in the aftermath. We owe the victims that much, at the very least.\n\nLet\u2019s do right by them,\n\nElla Tieno \nJr. Logistics Coordinator \nCovalex Shipping   \n'Anything you need, anywhere you need it.'",
